  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Well come and well met, my brave little spark",
      "time": "00:10.399",
      "end": "00:15.532",
      "words": [
        "00:10.399",
        "00:10.736",
        "00:11.161",
        "00:11.439",
        "00:11.691",
        "00:13.140",
        "00:13.374",
        "00:14.087",
        "00:14.620"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "How long you've wandered, burned bright as a star",
      "time": "00:15.740",
      "end": "00:20.715",
      "words": [
        "00:15.740",
        "00:15.919",
        "00:16.269",
        "00:16.557",
        "00:18.311",
        "00:18.541",
        "00:19.116",
        "00:19.502",
        "00:19.701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I have awaited you patiently all this time",
      "time": "00:20.878",
      "end": "00:27.939",
      "words": [
        "00:20.878",
        "00:21.208",
        "00:21.744",
        "00:22.145",
        "00:23.341",
        "00:23.674",
        "00:25.593",
        "00:25.827",
        "00:26.343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Past every fate",
      "time": "00:28.372",
      "end": "00:30.764",
      "words": [
        "00:28.372",
        "00:28.986",
        "00:30.193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now sing with me once more, share of your life",
      "time": "00:30.955",
      "end": "00:38.150",
      "words": [
        "00:30.955",
        "00:31.589",
        "00:32.189",
        "00:32.531",
        "00:32.848",
        "00:33.572",
        "00:34.876",
        "00:35.558",
        "00:35.901",
        "00:36.334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Far greater than memory, its loss and love words cannot hold",
      "time": "00:38.541",
      "end": "00:45.349",
      "words": [
        "00:38.541",
        "00:38.734",
        "00:39.374",
        "00:39.842",
        "00:41.499",
        "00:41.933",
        "00:42.411",
        "00:42.695",
        "00:43.068",
        "00:43.750",
        "00:44.545"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Boundless the tale overflows",
      "time": "00:45.582",
      "end": "00:51.764",
      "words": [
        "00:45.582",
        "00:46.844",
        "00:47.202",
        "00:48.230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And carries your light out to sea",
      "time": "00:52.443",
      "end": "01:01.290",
      "words": [
        "00:52.443",
        "00:53.322",
        "00:54.934",
        "00:56.115",
        "00:56.679",
        "00:57.230",
        "00:57.580"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember the rain, near and far beloved",
      "time": "01:02.589",
      "end": "01:07.491",
      "words": [
        "01:02.589",
        "01:03.514",
        "01:03.841",
        "01:05.132",
        "01:05.441",
        "01:05.778",
        "01:06.432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Each drop a blessing from heavens above",
      "time": "01:07.811",
      "end": "01:12.771",
      "words": [
        "01:07.811",
        "01:08.016",
        "01:08.374",
        "01:08.671",
        "01:10.395",
        "01:10.587",
        "01:11.753"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And how as time flowed on those waters became one",
      "time": "01:13.000",
      "end": "01:19.941",
      "words": [
        "01:13.000",
        "01:13.275",
        "01:13.908",
        "01:14.142",
        "01:14.734",
        "01:15.192",
        "01:15.546",
        "01:15.876",
        "01:17.608",
        "01:18.388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Streams, rivers and lakes",
      "time": "01:20.236",
      "end": "01:22.901",
      "words": [
        "01:20.236",
        "01:21.056",
        "01:22.073",
        "01:22.324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reaching for the horizon and far beyond",
      "time": "01:23.069",
      "end": "01:30.171",
      "words": [
        "01:23.069",
        "01:23.693",
        "01:24.251",
        "01:24.691",
        "01:26.980",
        "01:27.493",
        "01:28.376"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They carry onward however changed with each brief reflection, by setting sun",
      "time": "01:30.667",
      "end": "01:39.959",
      "words": [
        "01:30.667",
        "01:30.899",
        "01:31.512",
        "01:32.479",
        "01:33.962",
        "01:34.624",
        "01:34.916",
        "01:35.142",
        "01:35.921",
        "01:37.712",
        "01:38.228",
        "01:39.361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By storm's wake",
      "time": "01:40.285",
      "end": "01:44.059",
      "words": [
        "01:40.285",
        "01:41.081",
        "01:41.701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "'Til welcomed home to gentle sea",
      "time": "01:44.545",
      "end": "01:53.990",
      "words": [
        "01:44.545",
        "01:45.412",
        "01:47.128",
        "01:48.173",
        "01:48.795",
        "01:49.754"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sinking deeper and deeper in calm embrace",
      "time": "01:54.264",
      "end": "01:59.207",
      "words": [
        "01:54.264",
        "01:54.968",
        "01:55.928",
        "01:56.236",
        "01:57.257",
        "01:57.588",
        "01:58.187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Loving tides sweep in and bear you down",
      "time": "01:59.544",
      "end": "02:04.296",
      "words": [
        "01:59.544",
        "02:00.116",
        "02:00.574",
        "02:00.950",
        "02:01.383",
        "02:01.850",
        "02:02.284",
        "02:02.701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Should you meet a soul rising surface-ways",
      "time": "02:04.768",
      "end": "02:09.646",
      "words": [
        "02:04.768",
        "02:05.104",
        "02:05.447",
        "02:05.888",
        "02:06.176",
        "02:06.616",
        "02:07.867"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With your unbeating heart, wish them well",
      "time": "02:09.930",
      "end": "02:16.142",
      "words": [
        "02:09.930",
        "02:10.242",
        "02:10.545",
        "02:11.725",
        "02:12.355",
        "02:12.730",
        "02:13.184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep dark, far away, I have heard your voice, weighed your every choice",
      "time": "02:18.518",
      "end": "02:27.733",
      "words": [
        "02:18.518",
        "02:19.142",
        "02:20.115",
        "02:20.471",
        "02:22.730",
        "02:22.983",
        "02:23.383",
        "02:23.692",
        "02:24.325",
        "02:25.308",
        "02:25.621",
        "02:25.993",
        "02:26.971"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now our hands join round the meaning you sought",
      "time": "02:27.929",
      "end": "02:33.799",
      "words": [
        "02:27.929",
        "02:28.230",
        "02:28.547",
        "02:29.480",
        "02:30.063",
        "02:30.788",
        "02:31.459",
        "02:32.628",
        "02:32.835"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll catch your tears, quench your fears with joy 'til you near the shore",
      "time": "02:34.160",
      "end": "02:43.279",
      "words": [
        "02:34.160",
        "02:35.726",
        "02:35.980",
        "02:36.350",
        "02:38.291",
        "02:38.558",
        "02:38.909",
        "02:39.799",
        "02:40.042",
        "02:40.970",
        "02:41.224",
        "02:41.588",
        "02:42.304",
        "02:42.558"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Where in time, all shall as hope be reborn, ah",
      "time": "02:43.563",
      "end": "02:53.812",
      "words": [
        "02:43.563",
        "02:43.880",
        "02:44.216",
        "02:45.250",
        "02:45.774",
        "02:46.470",
        "02:47.117",
        "02:48.187",
        "02:48.421",
        "02:49.870"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hush, love, close your eyes, and in sleep abide",
      "time": "03:08.173",
      "end": "03:14.718",
      "words": [
        "03:08.173",
        "03:08.730",
        "03:09.717",
        "03:09.962",
        "03:10.271",
        "03:12.317",
        "03:12.605",
        "03:12.914",
        "03:13.289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As sun's distant light, echoes down to dreams below",
      "time": "03:14.947",
      "end": "03:23.424",
      "words": [
        "03:14.947",
        "03:15.168",
        "03:15.601",
        "03:16.559",
        "03:17.518",
        "03:18.242",
        "03:20.055",
        "03:21.058",
        "03:22.141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Know you will wake, on winds rise again",
      "time": "03:23.716",
      "end": "03:30.263",
      "words": [
        "03:23.716",
        "03:25.391",
        "03:25.645",
        "03:25.981",
        "03:27.994",
        "03:28.244",
        "03:28.594",
        "03:28.973"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For this journey's end is but one step forward to tomorrow",
      "time": "03:30.506",
      "end": "03:45.184",
      "words": [
        "03:30.506",
        "03:30.801",
        "03:31.151",
